  "description": "Wanderosa C Rival GX AXS Transmission is an adventure ebike made for the most ambitious gravel rides you can dream up. Its efficient carbon fiber frame features our progressive gravel geometry for comfort and confidence in the saddle at higher speeds.\n\nThis bike is built to take your Adventure by Bike farther and faster than ever. Washboard roads? 29 x 2.2″ tires paired with 120mm front and 110mm rear suspension travel soaks them up. Daunting elevation profile? The FAZUA 60 drive unit helps you save your legs for later. Big miles? On-bike cargo mounts ensure you can carry the tools, water, and snacks you need to avoid bonks and breakdowns.\n\nSRAM’s Rival GX AXS Transmission delivers the swift, accurate shifting you want when you’re focused on the scenery. Where will you wander with the ultimate adventure ebike?\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
